+# PUT /api/sheets/{sheetId}/claims/{claimId}/hold — toggles the hold on an OPEN or PENDING claim: holds it (CLAIM_HELD)
+# or, when held, releases it (CLAIM_RELEASED). A held claim not bound by a statement counts in no live total, as a held
+# person's claims do. Refused with 422 for any other status; nothing is stored. 404 for a claim not on the sheet.
